{"id":"schande","lemma":"Schande","pos":"noun","rank":1333,"glosses":["disgrace, infamy, dishonour (state or result considered highly disreputable for whoever is responsible)"],"ipa":"/ˈʃandə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/22/De-Schande.ogg/De-Schande.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Schande"},"examples":[{"text":"Was für eine Schande!","en":"What a shame!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/41643","words":[null,null,{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"what"]]},{"text":"Das ist keine Schande.","en":"There's no shame in that.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Sie haben Schande über unsere Familie gebracht.","en":"You have brought shame upon our family.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},null,{"g":"[with accusative or…"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},{"g":"family"},{"g":"brought, carried"}]},{"text":"Es ist eine Schande, was passiert ist.","en":"What happened was a disgrace.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"what"},{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Mach mir keine Schande!","en":"Don't misbehave.","words":[{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]}]}